WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.000
What a job interview looks like. Here is what will happen.

2
00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:11.280
We arrive and wait. Our name gets called.

3
00:00:11.280 --> 00:00:17.568
We sit at a table. One or two people sit across from us.

4
00:00:17.568 --> 00:00:21.360
They say hello and say who they are.

5
00:00:21.360 --> 00:00:28.872
They ask questions, one at a time. Thinking before answering is allowed.

6
00:00:28.872 --> 00:00:35.304
We may take notes in, and look at them. That is allowed too.

7
00:00:35.304 --> 00:00:41.016
We can ask for a question to be repeated, or ask for a moment.

8
00:00:41.016 --> 00:00:47.472
At the end they say when they will tell us the result. Then we leave.

9
00:00:47.472 --> 00:00:55.680
All done. Now you know what will happen. You can watch this again any time.

